## Code Verification Summary - Task I5.T3: Platform Admin Console

### ✅ Verification Status: COMPLETE

All acceptance criteria have been met and verified. The Platform Admin console backend and UI implementation is complete with full RBAC enforcement, impersonation governance, health metrics, audit exports, and SSE real-time updates.

